@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+The billing implementation defines a 30-day refund window. Treat that window as an eligibility boundary, not as proof that a refund was approved, issued, or received.
+
+No invoice lookup, invoice-correction workflow, payment-status source, or refund-execution authority is established in this repository. For refund and invoice disputes, use available customer and project evidence, avoid inventing billing facts or promising an outcome, and escalate when eligibility, invoice accuracy, payment state, or the required action cannot be established.

